  load-bearing invariant and pads it with paragraphs of code-level contract.
  Every cap exceeded; the body Strategy quotes exact stderr message text the
  implementor should literally use. These belong in code constants with unit
  tests asserting the exact strings, not in a domain spec.
misalignment:
  - spec-bloat
